 "notes": [
  "Nov 22, 2026: Added to the vault exactly as pasted, then made legal (99 + Miles).",
  "Nov 22, 2026: Middle wants it to lean into Gods with Thor + Beta Ray Bill (Secret Lair kit, kitchen-table OK). Suggested upgrades are in Adds, each with its paired cut.",
  "Nov 25, 2026: Main list replaced with his actual sleeved deck (from a photo) and trimmed to a legal 99 (Leonardo, the Balance out — 5-colour, illegal under Miles).",
  "Nov 25, 2026: KEEP — never suggest cutting: Michelangelo, the Heart; The Sentry, Golden Guardian; The Thing, Ben Grimm; Iron Fist, Hero for Hire; Strength of Will; Together Forever; Spider-Man India.",
  "Nov 25, 2026: In today: Bast, Heroic Intervention, High Score, Level Up, Valkyrior Skyrider, Sif's Spearmaster, Loki Laufeyson, Beta Ray Bill, Skyshroud Elf, Fire-Lit Thicket, Rishkar, Champion of Lambholt, Overrun, Harmonize, Dictate of Heliod, Ajani, Thor Asgard's Avenger, Hit-Monkey, Elvish Mystic, Avacyn's Pilgrim, Canopy Vista, Fortified Village.",
  "Nov 25, 2026: Out today: Black Panther Wakandan King, Take Up the Shield, Cheering Crowd, Fight to the Death, Restorative Technique, Infinity Formula, Costume Closet, Savage Land Dinosaur, Spider-Rex, Doctor Jane Foster, Stunning Shot, Scout the City, Doctor Strange, Mockingbird, Sudden Strike, White Tiger, Silver Sable, Radioactive Spider, Vibrant Cityscape, 1 Forest, 2 Mountain, 2 Plains.",
  "Nov 25, 2026: Land upgrade — Battlefield Forge, Clifftop Retreat, Cinder Glade, Game Trail, Karplusan Forest, Sunpetal Grove, Brushland in for Asgardian Citadel, Thriving Heath, Savage Mansion, Los Diablos Missile Base, Thriving Bluff, Birnin Zana Plaza, Thriving Grove. Family has extra copies, so Thanos keeps its Forge/Brushland/Karplusan too. 35 lands (7 Forest, 7 Mountain, 6 Plains + 15 nonbasic); 9 ramp pieces."
 ],
